SUMMARY:Royal Canadian Legion Literary Contest 2027
LOCATION:Canada-wide through local Legion branches\, Unknown
DESCRIPTION:This annual national pathway accepts Canadian students in Grade
 s 4 to 12\, including homeschool students\, through local Legion branches.
  Grade 4 belongs to the Junior category\, with an essay limit of 350 words
  or a poem limit of 32 lines on a Remembrance theme. English\, French\, an
 d bilingual entries are accepted. Each branch sets its own deadline\, and 
 no 2027 branch deadline is posted. October 1 marks the fall checking windo
 w.
URL:https://seminarschools.com/polymythseminars/events/royal-canadian-legio
 n-literary-contest-2027/
STATUS:TENTATIVE
